# 📖 TOEFL Reading - Day 01

## Passage

Solar energy is becoming more popular because it is clean and renewable.

---

## Question

Why is solar energy becoming more popular?

A. It is cheaper than water.

✅ B. It is clean and renewable.

C. It is difficult to use.

D. It produces pollution.

---

## Key Sentence

Solar energy is clean and renewable.
